family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">Blue</text></svg><p>Second-branch denominators are 7 (one counter removed). Find P(both red) and P(both blue).</p>"
          },
          {
            "label": "Step 2 — Calculate each path",
            "content": "<p>\\(P(\\text{red then red}) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{20}{56}\\)<br>\\(P(\\text{blue then blue}) = \\frac{3}{8} \\times \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{6}{56}\\)</p>"
          },
          {
            "label": "Answer",
            "content": "<p><strong>\\(P(\\text{same colour}) = \\frac{20}{56} + \\frac{6}{56} = \\frac{26}{56} = \\dfrac{13}{28}\\)</strong></p>",
