      {
        "difficulty": "Gold",
        "question": "The Venn diagram below shows hobbies for 25 students. A student is chosen at random. Using the conditional probability formula P(A|B) = P(A and B) / P(B) (given), find P(A|B).",
        "steps": [
          {
            "label": "Step 1 — Read the Venn diagram",
            "content": "<svg class=\"venn-diagram\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 160\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"80\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" fill-opacity=\"0.25\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"80\" r=\"60\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.25\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"75\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"600\">7</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"600\">4</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"600\">9</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">5</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e40af\">A only</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">B only</text></svg><p>A only = 7, A∩B = 4, B only = 9, neither = 5. Total = 25.</p>"
          },
          {
            "label": "Step 2 — Find P(A and B) and P(B)",
            "content": "<p>\\(P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{4}{25}\\). Total in B = 4 + 9 = 13. \\(P(B) = \\frac{13}{25}\\)</p>"
          },
          {
            "label": "Step 3 — Apply the formula",
            "content": "<p>\\(P(A|B) = \\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(B)} = \\frac{4/25}{13/25} = \\frac{4}{13}\\)</p>"
          },
          {
            "label": "Answer",
            "content": "<p><strong>\\(P(A|B) = \\dfrac{4}{13}\\)</strong></p>",
            "isAnswer": true
          }
        ]
      }
